Kingdom - a game where you have to defend your kingdom fish from bad fish

godot/      The game, on Godot 4 (GDScript). Open godot/project.godot in the
            Godot editor (4.3 or newer) and press F5, or run:
                godot --path godot

src/        The original Java Swing version (kept for reference).
resources/  Art used by the Java version.
tools/      GenExplosionSounds.java - regenerates the rocket explosion sounds:
                java tools/GenExplosionSounds.java

Controls: WASD / arrows - move, Ctrl (or J) - rocket, Space - bubble shield,
Esc (or P) - pause.
